  "description": "ZIJSUI crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H108 N28 O60 Tb8. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb7 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb8 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.763-3.836 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.24-112.51°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C64H108N28O60Tb8. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 12 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
